WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.950
Synthetic media is content generated or altered with artificial intelligence or related

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.640
computational techniques.

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:10.515
It can include images, video, audio, text, documents, and screenshots.

00:00:10.515 --> 00:00:14.045
Synthetic content may be creative, educational, assistive, misleading,

00:00:14.045 --> 00:00:16.428
or harmful depending on purpose and presentation.

00:00:16.428 --> 00:00:21.240
A deepfake is AI-generated or AI-altered media that represents a person, event, action,

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:22.240
or statement.

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:25.060
The term often describes face, voice, or motion manipulation,

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:28.989
but analysts should avoid using it as a label for every suspicious file.

00:00:28.989 --> 00:00:32.860
Ordinary editing changes real media through cropping, color adjustment, compositing,

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:33.720
or sequencing.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.700
Manipulation changes meaning or evidence.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:38.760
Fully synthetic media is generated rather than captured.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:40.080
Satire may be clearly signaled,

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:43.680
while deception attempts to make an audience accept a false claim.

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:46.930
Real media can also mislead when staged, clipped, given a false caption,

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:49.575
or presented as evidence of a different time or place.

00:00:49.575 --> 00:00:52.845
Verification therefore asks more than whether pixels were generated.

00:00:52.845 --> 00:00:57.221
It asks whether the claimed source, event, identity, date, and context are supported.

00:00:57.221 --> 00:01:00.760
Analysts need careful habits because intuitive visual judgment is unreliable.

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:04.470
Compression, poor lighting, frame interpolation, translation, editing,

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:07.280
and platform processing can resemble synthetic artifacts.

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:10.020
High-quality generation may show no obvious defect.

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:13.360
The objective is disciplined assessment, not panic or instant certainty.

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:17.440
Preserve the media and claim, investigate provenance, compare independent evidence,

00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:21.680
describe technical clues cautiously, and communicate what is known, unknown, and inferred.
